            "text": "STS provides comprehensive electronics recycling and ITAD services for Bakersfield and Kern County including computer recycling, laptop recycling, data destruction, hard drive shredding, server recycling, and healthcare IT disposal. Equipment collected in Bakersfield is staged locally and transported to our certified processing facilities in Jacksonville and Houston, Texas for NIST 800-88 compliant destruction and full chain of custody documentation. Free pickup is available for qualifying volumes from energy sites, agricultural operations, hospitals, schools, and government buildings."
