            "text": "Yes, STS offers complimentary pickup for qualifying volumes throughout Bakersfield and Kern County. Scheduling is flexible to accommodate business operations, energy field sites, agricultural processing facilities, and healthcare environments. Organizations searching for electronics recycling near me in Kern County receive same-week response with secure transport and documented chain of custody from pickup through final processing."
