            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "STS implements data sanitization procedures adhering to NIST SP 800-88 Rev. 2 and DoD 5220.22-M benchmarks. Our workflows meet HIPAA data protection standards, California universal waste mandates, and EPA guidelines for commercial electronics disposal."
