        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "What service areas do you cover across Kern County?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Our fleet collects commercial equipment throughout Bakersfield, including Downtown, Rosedale, Oildale, and the Stockdale Industrial Park. We also arrange scheduled enterprise pickups across Delano, Wasco, Shafter, and surrounding Southern Central Valley facilities."
