        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "Is business pickup really offered without cost?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Yes, STS offers complimentary pickup services for qualifying quantities of corporate IT equipment. Qualifying inventories typically include combinations of computers, servers, networking switches, laptops, and mobile devices from commercial or educational entities."
