            "text": "Our nationwide infrastructure regularly coordinates complex, multi-facility IT asset retirements. We manage palletized enterprise pickups, server room clearouts, and large facility updates including data center decommissioning with consistent chain of custody documentation."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "What happens to electronic equipment after pickup in Bakersfield?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Equipment collected from Bakersfield businesses is staged securely and transported to our certified processing facilities in Jacksonville and Houston, Texas. There, all storage media undergo complete data sanitization before hardware is either remarketed or recycled into raw commodities under strict zero-landfill protocols."
          }
        },
